{"unit_id":"qyw233__dsh-deeplink#feature-1","repo":"qyw233/dsh-deeplink","commit":"fffa63a8906c962625d79ab62469e2ce03aee9b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deeplink 的功能「会话深链」：页面读取 URL 中的 session 参数，等会话列表就绪后打开对应会话；找不到目标时保留当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:65-73","lib/client.js:105-122"]}
